# finish/mote: the living finish's mote (STYLE_P2 27.7; P2C_CONTRACTS 6b `fx mote`; LADDER-FINISH, ladder polish i1 + i2):
# a rising spark drawn as a particle. Polish i2 (the panel: "the motes are 1-2 px sparks, easy to miss"): a1 (its first
# third) a 3x3 plus, a white core in Glow 2 arms; a2 (the middle third) the plus with a Glow 3 core; a3 (the last third) a
# 1x2 streak fading up. PROPOSED for the view (art_fx.h's particles draw a 1 px core with a soft 4-neighbour glow today):
# drawn opaque as this sprite, a mote reads at 1x.
